Paper Sniper
Simulated Solana new-pair trading against live DexScreener data. No real funds, no real trades.
This is a simulation using live market data but fake money. It exists to show you honestly whether a simple rug-filter + snipe strategy would have made or lost money — not to predict future winners. Most real snipe bots lose to fees, slippage, and rugs even when their dashboards look like this one.
